Attribution: please cite this repository as the source.

Carve-out: the filled tax forms in pdfs/ are built on blank IRS form
templates, which are works of the United States Government and in the
public domain (17 U.S.C. § 105); the underlying form layout and
preprinted text are not covered by the CC BY 4.0 license and carry no
copyright. The IRS requests credit to irs.gov as the source of the
forms. The filled-in values are fabricated throughout — these are
synthetic research documents, not valid tax filings. This project is
not affiliated with or endorsed by the IRS.

All personally identifiable information in every document is
fabricated. Real brand and institution names that appear in
transaction descriptions or as insurance carriers are used
nominatively for realism; every identifier associated with them
(account numbers, phone numbers, policy numbers) is fabricated.
Email addresses and web domains of fictional organizations are
invented; any resemblance to registered domains or real addresses
is coincidental.
